          <details class="adv"><summary>If something is missing</summary><div class="fallbacks">${sc.basis === 'either' ? '<div><b>If the meter goes quiet:</b> the calendar leg takes over and the list says so.</div>' : sc.basis === 'meter' ? '<div><b>If the meter goes quiet:</b> this runs on run-hours alone, so nothing on the calendar takes over; the list says so.</div>' : ''}<div><b>If it is still open when the next one is due:</b> no duplicate; the miss is recorded against the open one.</div><div><b>If the machine is in maintenance mode:</b> the next occurrence still comes; the machine\'s alerts pause, not its work.</div>${sc.performedBy === 'vendor' ? '<div><b>If the vendor misses a visit:</b> it goes overdue in their name and counts on the vendor scorecard.</div>' : ''}</div></details>
